<title>ESTONIA: EMV TO SET 15 KROON DIV, MOVE TO MAIN LIST.</title>
<headline>EMV TO SET 15 KROON DIV, MOVE TO MAIN LIST.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Estonia's second largest construction group EMV said on Thursday that it would propose a 15 kroon dividend at its shareholder meeting in April and also a move to the main list of the stock exchange.</p>
<p>The company also said in a statement that it would decrease the nominal value of its shares to 100 kroons from 10 kroons, which would result in a share capital rise to 47.4 million kroons from 474,000 kroons.</p>
</text>
